      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=119874",
      "title": "World News Day 2026: Time to fight",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/09/world-news-day-2026-time-to-fight/",
      "published": "Fri, 04 Sep 2026 09:18:50 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>Branko Brkic has lived in two societies at breaking point, with opposite outcomes: 1980s Yugoslavia, where shared facts fell apart until the country tore itself to pieces, and South Africa, where journalists dug through state capture until the theft could no longer be denied, and hope was restored. Two experiences taught him the same thing from opposite directions. Read his message for World News Day.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/09/world-news-day-2026-time-to-fight/\">World News Day 2026: Time to fight</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://wan-ifra.org/?p=119895",
      "title": "Combating hate and scaling revenue: The evolution of publisher social tools",
      "link": "https://wan-ifra.org/2026/09/combating-hate-and-scaling-revenue-the-evolution-of-publisher-social-tools/",
      "published": "Fri, 04 Sep 2026 08:30:54 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "<p>As publishers confront toxic comment sections and AI-driven misinformation, Germany’s largest network of local news brands has deployed a new tool to drive healthier engagement – increasing digital revenue \"roughly sixfold.\"</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org/2026/09/combating-hate-and-scaling-revenue-the-evolution-of-publisher-social-tools/\">Combating hate and scaling revenue: The evolution of publisher social tools</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://wan-ifra.org\">WAN-IFRA</a>.</p>",
      "source": "WAN-IFRA"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://www.niemanlab.org/?p=252885",
      "title": "With acquisition of Vermont newspapers, the National Trust for Local News expands to a fourth state",
      "link": "https://www.niemanlab.org/2026/09/with-acquisition-of-vermont-newspapers-the-national-trust-for-local-news-expands-to-a-fourth-state/",
      "published": "Thu, 03 Sep 2026 21:12:53 +0000",
      "summary_raw": "The nonprofit National Trust for Local News is acquiring the Vermont Community Newspaper Group in a deal that will close this month, the Trust announced Thursday. The deal, which will add five weekly newspapers covering more than a dozen northern Vermont communities to the Trust&#8217;s portfolio, expands the nonprofit&#8217;s footprint to a fourth state, joining...",
      "source": "Nieman Lab"
    },
    {
      "id": "https://www.niemanlab.org/?p=252774",
