      "summary_raw": "He&#8217;s doing it again: Donald Trump has decided that Lake Ontario is actually Lake America. This follows his similar declaration last year that the Gulf of Mexico was actually the Gulf of America. (How long until we learn that the Rockies are actually the American Mountains?) Trump&#8217;s power over what the federal government calls bodies...",
      "source": "Nieman Lab"
    },
